### Wymień wszystkie koktajle z bazy danych.
GET http://localhost:3000/cocktails

### Wymień koktajl po ID.
GET http://localhost:3000/cocktails/26

###
GET http://localhost:3000/cocktails/24

### Utwórz nowy koktajl.
POST http://localhost:3000/cocktails
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Podwójna wóda zmieszana z potrójną wódą",
  "recipe": "wlej do szklanki 2 kieliszki wódki, po tym zalej to 3 kieliszkami wódki",
  "photoUrl": "ebeebebe",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": 6,
      "amount": 50
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 6,
      "amount": 50
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 6,
      "amount": 50
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 6,
      "amount": 50
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 6,
      "amount": 50
    }
  ]
}

### Zaktualizuj koktajl po ID.
PATCH http://localhost:3000/cocktails/26
Authorization: Bearer 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kamikaze(blue)",
  "recipe": "An updated description for the classic cocktail.",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": 1,
      "amount": 60
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 2,
      "amount": 30
    },
    {
      "ingredientId": 3,
      "amount": 20
    }
  ]
}

### Usuń koktajl po ID.
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cocktails/{{cocktailId}}

### usuwanie
### Usuwanie koktajlu
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cocktails/26
Authorization: Bearer 